      "desire": "",
      "touchstones": "<h3>Convictions</h3><ul><li>Nobody gets left alone in the alley</li><li>A badge is a promise, not a license</li></ul><h3>Touchstones</h3><ul><li><strong>Dani Okeke</strong>: His best boxer, 19 years old, whom he&#39;s preparing for her first professional fight.</li></ul>",
